<title>UK: IBCA rates Kingfisher 2007 notes A l-term.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates Kingfisher 2007 notes A l-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency, said on Friday it assigned a long-term rating of A to the 200 million stg 8.125 percent notes due 2007 issued by Kingfisher Plc.  </p>
<p>&quot;Kingfisher, a leading British non-food retailer with growing interests in Continental Europe, recently announced strong results during the important Christmas trading period,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
